Hospital "1" -- "*" Diagnosis : records
Hospital "1" -- "*" ActualTreatment : manages

Doctor "1" -- "*" Diagnosis : poses
Doctor "1" -- "*" ActualTreatment : defines
Doctor "1" -- "*" Examination : prescribes

Patient "1" -- "*" Diagnosis : receives
Patient "1" -- "*" ActualTreatment : undergoes

Diagnosis "1" -- "1" ActualTreatment : results in
TreatmentPlan "1" -- "*" ExaminationType : advises

ActualTreatment "1" *-- "*" Examination : consists of
ActualTreatment "1" *-- "*" MedicalAction : consists of
ActualTreatment "1" -- "0..1" TreatmentPlan : based on

Examination "0..1" -- "1" ExaminationType : is of type
Examination "0..1" -- "1" Hospital : performed at

@enduml

